    {
      "text": "因为您的产品上市时间至关重要",
      "tag": "STRONG",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720546366",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "52px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH电器深知时间对您的业务至关重要，也明白及时了解生产流程对于您品牌决策的重要性。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720546366",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "因此，我们会在您下单后为您配备专属项目经理，随时向您汇报定制新产品项目的进展情况。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720546366",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
